abstract: >-
  Research data and computational materials supporting a doctoral study of
  institutional financial-education glossaries from 18 Spanish-speaking
  countries. The release contains the normalized and deduplicated lemma
  inventory, the provisional terminologically consolidated inventory,
  analysis scripts, a glossary-source manifest, and selected SKOS/RDF samples.
keywords:
  - financial education
  - Spanish terminology
  - terminography
  - pluricentric Spanish
  - knowledge organization
  - SKOS
  - linguistic linked data
  - FAIR data
  - natural language processing
